   "title": "Prompt",
   "properties": {
    "Node name for S&R": "CLIPTextEncode"
   },
   "widgets_values": [
    "Create an original premium fantasy role-playing game inventory asset. ITEM: enchanted crystal sword. Exquisite hand-painted digital illustration, carefully designed fantasy craftsmanship, intricate ornamental details, elegant stylized proportions. Rich magical materials, polished metal, carved gemstones, aged leather, engraved decorative surfaces, subtle luminous energy. A sophisticated palette of sapphire blue, deep violet, antique gold, and muted silver. Beautifully defined silhouette, consistent object scale, crisp painterly edges, excellent readability at small icon sizes. Professional high-quality game inventory asset with detailed surface textures and controlled lighting. Single centered isolated object, generous empty margins, simple uniform plain white background suitable for later background removal. No environment, no hands, no characters, no floor, no interface, no typography, no logos. Completely original fantasy item design, no references to existing games or fictional franchises. Square format."
   ]
